Voidwalkers have skills like Torment, which generates taunt and threat, Consume Shadows for out-of-combat health regeneration, Sacrifice to shield the Warlock, and Suffering for AoE taunt and threat generation. These abilities are great for tanking and sustaining in battles, making Voidwalkers versatile in combat scenarios.

